From: alvesmaicon <alvesmaiconn@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: sun8i-codec-analog: power the headphone amplifier up before the DACs

The headphone amplifier is an output driver, so DAPM powers it up last,
after the DACs and the mixers feeding it. Its output ramp then goes out
with the path already up, and the headphones hear it as a low thump at
the start of every sound that finds the path down.

Powered up first, with the DACs and the mixers still off, the same ramp
is not heard. In a blind test on the console, three cold starts each
way, the thump was there on all three with the amplifier last and on
none with the amplifier first.

Split the amplifier in two: a supply that enables it and waits for it to
settle, which DAPM runs before the DACs, and the output driver, now
without a register, which still disables it first on the way down.

diff --git a/sound/soc/sunxi/sun8i-codec-analog.c b/sound/soc/sunxi/sun8i-codec-analog.c
--- a/sound/soc/sunxi/sun8i-codec-analog.c
+++ b/sound/soc/sunxi/sun8i-codec-analog.c
@@ -421,10 +421,11 @@ static int sun8i_headphone_amp_event(struct snd_soc_dapm_widget *w,
 static const struct snd_soc_dapm_widget sun8i_codec_headphone_widgets[] = {
 	SND_SOC_DAPM_MUX("Headphone Source Playback Route",
 			 SND_SOC_NOPM, 0, 0, sun8i_codec_hp_src),
-	SND_SOC_DAPM_OUT_DRV_E("Headphone Amp", SUN8I_ADDA_PAEN_HP_CTRL,
-			       SUN8I_ADDA_PAEN_HP_CTRL_HPPAEN, 0, NULL, 0,
-			       sun8i_headphone_amp_event,
-			       SND_SOC_DAPM_PRE_PMU | SND_SOC_DAPM_PRE_PMD),
+	/* Up first, before the DACs and mixers; down first, as an output driver */
+	SND_SOC_DAPM_SUPPLY("Headphone Amp Power", SND_SOC_NOPM, 0, 0,
+			    sun8i_headphone_amp_event, SND_SOC_DAPM_PRE_PMU),
+	SND_SOC_DAPM_OUT_DRV_E("Headphone Amp", SND_SOC_NOPM, 0, 0, NULL, 0,
+			       sun8i_headphone_amp_event, SND_SOC_DAPM_PRE_PMD),
 	SND_SOC_DAPM_SUPPLY("HPCOM Protection", SUN8I_ADDA_PAEN_HP_CTRL,
 			    SUN8I_ADDA_PAEN_HP_CTRL_COMPTEN, 0, NULL, 0),
 	SND_SOC_DAPM_REG(snd_soc_dapm_supply, "HPCOM", SUN8I_ADDA_PAEN_HP_CTRL,
@@ -438,6 +439,7 @@ static const struct snd_soc_dapm_route sun8i_codec_headphone_routes[] = {
 	{ "Headphone Source Playback Route", "Mixer", "Left Mixer" },
 	{ "Headphone Source Playback Route", "Mixer", "Right Mixer" },
 	{ "Headphone Amp", NULL, "Headphone Source Playback Route" },
+	{ "Headphone Amp", NULL, "Headphone Amp Power" },
 	{ "HPCOM", NULL, "HPCOM Protection" },
 	{ "HP", NULL, "Headphone Amp" },
 };
